  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial Contribution for Energy Community Secretariat</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Finan&#x10D;n&#xFD; pr&#xED;spevok pre Energy Community Secretariat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Podpora Moldavskej republiky pri rie&#x161;en&#xED; energetickej kr&#xED;zy a kr&#xED;zy energetickej chudoby - poskytovanie financi&#xED; na zvy&#x161;ovanie energetickej efekt&#xED;vnosti. Projekt realizovan&#xFD; mimovl&#xE1;dnou organiz&#xE1;ciou Expert-Grup (na z&#xE1;klade tripartitnej dohody medzi Sekretari&#xE1;tom Energetick&#xE9;ho spolo&#x10D;enstva, Ministerstvom energetiky Moldavskej republiky a mimovl&#xE1;dnou organiz&#xE1;ciou Expert-Grup) viedol k zv&#xFD;&#x161;eniu energetickej efekt&#xED;vnosti budovy na adresa: ulica Stefan cel Mare 3A, Balti, Moldavsko</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of the Republic of Moldova in solving the energy crisis and the energy poverty crisis - providing financing for increasing energy efficiency. The project implemented by the NGO Expert-Grup (based on the tripartite agreement between Energy Community Secretariat, The Ministry of Energy of the Republic of Moldova, and the non-governmental organization Expert-Grup) resulting in increased the energy efficiency of the building on the address: 3A Stefan cel Mare street, Balti, Moldova</narrative>
  </description>
